{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Feed, cuddle, and tuck them in!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your tiny desktop companions will never leave you alone! Choose your own digital pet, feed it, and form a peaceful bond. Accompanied by soothing sounds and a relaxing atmosphere, care for your adorable cat, rabbit, or hedgehog friend. In this desktop pet simulation, you can escape the hustle and bustle of daily life and take a tranquil break in your own little world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Give all your love!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the paw icon to move your mouse over your pet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647690/extras/8476aa4d7f9ec649ee7e6842f56ed94c.poster.webp?t=1751375505\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647690/extras/8476aa4d7f9ec649ee7e6842f56ed94c.webp?t=1751375505\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pet Management!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To adopt a new pet, you\u2019ll need to buy a new home for it first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647690/extras/14bb91e5b6acc8c6bbf271a034dfee4c.poster.webp?t=1751375505\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647690/extras/14bb91e5b6acc8c6bbf271a034dfee4c.webp?t=1751375505\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3647690?t=1751375505","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647690/5f487e01709dafd30fffe5cb204c4666a1f95069/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751375505","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item